			],
			"Message": "docs(readme): Add Air component to architecture documentation\n\nThis commit updates the project's README to include the newly introduced Air component, a background daemon written in Rust that handles resource-intensive operations. The documentation now reflects the complete architecture by:\n\n- Adding Air to the main architecture table with its role description and primary technologies\n- Including Air in the elements table with its description and GitHub repository link\n- Updating Mountain's responsibilities to reflect its management of both Cocoon and Air processes\n\nThese changes ensure the documentation accurately represents the current system architecture and provides proper context for developers exploring the codebase.",
